  "prefLabel": "Puc 902.27 Standard Net Metering Tariff",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 902.27 “Standard Net Metering Tariff ” means the net energy metering tariff provisions as specified in RSA 362-A:9, as applicable to customer-generators receiving a utility net metering capacity allocation prior to September 1, 2017 and not in excess of the net metering cap applicable prior to commission adoption of the alternative net metering tariff.\n\nSource. #13080, eff 9-14-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc900.html"
